{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-hostile-species","chapterId":"handbook-monster-8003020","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-hostile-species-handbook-monster-8003020-handbook-monster-8003020-0","text":"不属此世的怪异生命，自星核带来的裂界中成长，寄生在世界的根基结构中汲取能量，其甲胄外壳上燃烧着星辰内核的烈焰。\n在战斗中，外宇宙之炎能轻易将敌人焚作灰烬。","speaker":""}]}
